        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "gfJyL",
          "name": "About",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "$white",
          "gap": 64,
          "padding": [
            64,
            140,
            88,
            140
          ],
          "alignItems": "center",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "luzg0",
              "name": "AboutText",
              "width": 560,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 20,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Ka8Ma",
                  "name": "Eyebrow",
                  "fill": "$indigo-700",
                  "content": "Dari komunitas, untuk yang penasaran.",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "VzODm",
                  "name": "Headline",
                  "fill": "$primary-dark",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Lahir dari kebingungan.\nTumbuh dari kebersamaan.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.12,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                  "fontSize": 38,
                  "fontWeight": "500"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "YRkBF",
                  "name": "Quote",
                  "fill": "$slate-700",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "“Kenapa kita nggak ciptakan aja ruangnya, tempat untuk berkumpul dan berbagi ilmu?”",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 19,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UeiWG",
                  "name": "P1",
                  "fill": "$slate-600",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Di awal masa kuliah, kami punya pertanyaan yang sama: mulai belajar dari mana, dan sama siapa? Materi sains, coding, dan teknologi tersebar di mana-mana.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MUTfM",
                  "name": "P3",
                  "fill": "$slate-600",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Dari kebingungan itu, Zenuniverse lahir. Sebuah ruang yang hangat dan terbuka, karena ilmu lebih bermakna ketika dibagikan dan belajar lebih seru ketika bersama.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "uTzwc",
                  "name": "EndNote",
                  "fill": "$slate-600",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Selama masih ada yang penasaran, perjalanan ini terus berlanjut.",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
